1
00:00:02,880 --> 00:00:04,920
So it was planned all along.

2
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:31,120
I really can't take this anymore

3
00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:32,439
I've told so many lies.

4
00:00:32,440 --> 00:00:33,560
I'm afraid karma will come for me.

5
00:00:35,280 --> 00:00:36,400
It won't.

6
00:00:37,440 --> 00:00:38,880
If karma comes for anyone,

7
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:40,000
it'll be me.

8
00:00:40,440 --> 00:00:41,840
It won't touch you.

9
00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:45,240
Thank you for helping me.

10
00:00:47,160 --> 00:00:49,000
There was a jigsaw puzzle in the back.

11
00:00:49,240 --> 00:00:50,559
Something felt off about it

12
00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:51,680
so I didn't bring it up.

13
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:52,920
See for yourself.

14
00:00:57,800 --> 00:00:59,720
You were right not to bring it up.

15
00:01:00,360 --> 00:01:01,360
Find somewhere

16
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:02,880
and hide it.

17
00:01:06,053 --> 00:01:07,053
Okay.

18
00:02:50,080 --> 00:02:51,280
Son.

19
00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:56,920
Son?

20
00:03:02,720 --> 00:03:03,880
Feiyu?

21
00:03:07,920 --> 00:03:09,280
Xu Feiyu?

22
00:03:17,840 --> 00:03:19,160
Xu Feiyu?

23
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:34,840
Feiyu.

24
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:36,400
Feiyu!

25
00:03:36,401 --> 00:03:37,920
What are you doing?

26
00:03:38,320 --> 00:03:39,160
Feiyu!

27
00:03:39,161 --> 00:03:40,280
What are you doing!

28
00:03:40,360 --> 00:03:41,360
Feiyu.

29
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:43,680
Stop scratching! Feiyu.

30
00:03:44,640 --> 00:03:46,959
What's wrong? What's wrong?

31
00:03:46,960 --> 00:03:47,440
Ah.

32
00:03:47,440 --> 00:03:48,440
Feiyu.

33
00:03:48,640 --> 00:03:49,160
Feiyu.

34
00:03:49,161 --> 00:03:51,119
Stop scratching, stop scratching.

35
00:03:51,120 --> 00:03:53,120
Mom's right here.

36
00:03:53,240 --> 00:03:54,399
Look at Mom.

37
00:03:54,400 --> 00:03:55,600
Look at Mom.

38
00:03:56,120 --> 00:03:57,240
What's in your mouth?

39
00:03:57,600 --> 00:03:58,879
What's in your mouth!

40
00:03:58,880 --> 00:03:59,959
Ah! Spit it out!

41
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:01,920
Feiyu, spit it out!

42
00:04:02,480 --> 00:04:03,560
Spit it out.

43
00:04:06,600 --> 00:04:07,600
Feiyu.

44
00:04:08,520 --> 00:04:09,520
What is it?

45
00:04:10,440 --> 00:04:11,160
Feiyu.

46
00:04:11,320 --> 00:04:12,320
What's wrong?

47
00:04:13,440 --> 00:04:15,160
So many rats.

48
00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:16,280
What?

49
00:04:16,320 --> 00:04:18,159
So many… rats.

50
00:04:18,160 --> 00:04:19,160
Rats.

51
00:04:21,520 --> 00:04:23,680
Rats? There are no rats.

52
00:04:24,643 --> 00:04:25,136
Feiyu...

53
00:04:28,340 --> 00:04:29,400
No rats.

54
00:04:29,401 --> 00:04:30,480
There are no rats.

55
00:04:32,760 --> 00:04:33,480
Mom's here.

56
00:05:03,526 --> 00:05:06,640
He... had an allergic reaction

57
00:05:06,960 --> 00:05:08,400
but he's all right now.

58
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:15,680
You should go back and rest.

59
00:05:33,480 --> 00:05:34,480
Yong Qi.

60
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:37,480
Tell me.

61
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:40,640
Did I do the wrong thing again?

62
00:05:43,120 --> 00:05:44,480
Are you backing out?

63
00:05:45,920 --> 00:05:47,600
If you back out now

64
00:05:48,880 --> 00:05:51,120
then all Feiyu suffered was for nothing.

65
00:05:56,080 --> 00:05:57,160
I'm not backing out.

66
00:05:59,520 --> 00:06:00,920
It's just that...

67
00:06:02,400 --> 00:06:04,040
Feiyu doesn't deserve this.

68
00:06:11,280 --> 00:06:13,160
Let's leave things alone for now.

69
00:06:14,280 --> 00:06:16,360
I'm scared that if something else happens...

70
00:06:18,120 --> 00:06:20,200
I don't even know if Feiyu could take it.

71
00:06:25,440 --> 00:06:26,440
Mm…

72
00:07:06,800 --> 00:07:08,000
You're awake?

73
00:07:09,040 --> 00:07:10,040
Let me do that.

74
00:07:26,080 --> 00:07:27,040
Slow down

75
00:07:27,041 --> 00:07:28,200
don't choke.

76
00:07:34,040 --> 00:07:35,040
Are you hungry?

77
00:07:38,240 --> 00:07:39,240
No.

78
00:07:40,886 --> 00:07:41,880
So...

79
00:07:42,640 --> 00:07:43,720
feeling any better?

80
00:07:46,800 --> 00:07:48,280
Much better.

81
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:17,800
Song Yi had vanished from the world.

82
00:08:19,160 --> 00:08:20,320
In those nine months,

83
00:08:20,773 --> 00:08:23,679
I'd almost finished
my first manga series,

84
00:08:24,213 --> 00:08:26,413
"The Animals' First Glance."

85
00:08:26,800 --> 00:08:28,280
Ah, no. Wait.

86
00:08:29,640 --> 00:08:31,080
I didn't finish it alone.

87
00:08:31,713 --> 00:08:38,873
The two of us finished this manga
story, even though he wasn't with me.

88
00:08:39,320 --> 00:08:40,880
But he's right here in my book,

89
00:08:42,240 --> 00:08:43,840
always before my eyes.

90
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:17,120
Still no word from Feiyu?

91
00:09:18,400 --> 00:09:19,360
No.

92
00:09:19,361 --> 00:09:20,800
I'm used to it by now.

93
00:09:22,480 --> 00:09:24,560
You haven't tried reaching out to him?

94
00:09:26,040 --> 00:09:26,480
Ah.

95
00:09:26,480 --> 00:09:27,480
Never mind.

96
00:09:28,240 --> 00:09:30,199
He never says it out loud

97
00:09:30,200 --> 00:09:31,200
but I know

98
00:09:31,920 --> 00:09:33,080
deep down he hates me.

99
00:09:34,480 --> 00:09:36,480
It's been so long now.

100
00:09:37,240 --> 00:09:38,560
Maybe it's time to move on.

101
00:09:40,600 --> 00:09:41,880
You think so?

102
00:09:42,360 --> 00:09:43,519
After all this time

103
00:09:43,520 --> 00:09:45,200
I can't even get to see him.

104
00:09:47,400 --> 00:09:48,400
Ah well.

105
00:09:48,960 --> 00:09:50,000
I heard

106
00:09:50,240 --> 00:09:51,919
there's a comic he drew

107
00:09:51,920 --> 00:09:53,319
it's blowing up online lately

108
00:09:53,320 --> 00:09:54,360
I'm following it too.

109
00:09:56,640 --> 00:09:57,640
Look, look.

110
00:09:59,280 --> 00:10:01,280
"The Animals' First Glance"?

111
00:10:03,440 --> 00:10:05,280
Kind of a strange title.

112
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:07,280
Sounds like teen angst.

113
00:10:09,800 --> 00:10:11,640
When animals are born

114
00:10:12,080 --> 00:10:14,120
most of them bond with

115
00:10:14,400 --> 00:10:16,520
the first creature their eyes land on.

116
00:10:18,720 --> 00:10:18,960
Oh.

117
00:10:19,120 --> 00:10:20,320
So that's what it means.

118
00:10:20,800 --> 00:10:22,359
What's the comic about?

119
00:10:22,360 --> 00:10:24,280
You... you'd better not read it.

120
00:10:24,520 --> 00:10:26,280
This comic

121
00:10:26,720 --> 00:10:28,520
isn't really for someone your age.

122
00:10:29,440 --> 00:10:31,039
It's my son's.

123
00:10:31,040 --> 00:10:32,120
So why can't I read it?

124
00:10:33,720 --> 00:10:35,080
Hmm...

125
00:10:36,120 --> 00:10:39,800
It'd be like a mother sneaking
a look at her son's diary.

126
00:10:39,920 --> 00:10:40,920
Way too awkward.

127
00:10:41,920 --> 00:10:42,920
All right then.

128
00:10:44,800 --> 00:10:45,800
Oh right.

129
00:10:46,480 --> 00:10:48,719
Song Yi messaged me.

130
00:10:48,720 --> 00:10:50,480
He said he's back in Singapore.

131
00:10:52,000 --> 00:10:53,680
Why is he only going back now?

132
00:10:53,840 --> 00:10:55,720
He said he was in Europe before that.

133
00:10:56,800 --> 00:10:57,840
Europe?

134
00:11:09,663 --> 00:11:11,336
"The Animals' First Glance"

135
00:12:46,149 --> 00:12:47,823
[Banner for the Feiyu fan meeting]

136
00:13:35,200 --> 00:13:36,240
Song Yi!

137
00:13:42,720 --> 00:13:44,079
You came all this way

138
00:13:44,080 --> 00:13:45,080
so why not come in?

139
00:13:45,240 --> 00:13:46,360
Scared to face me?

140
00:13:49,400 --> 00:13:51,000
I just thought you'd be busy.

141
00:13:52,520 --> 00:13:54,879
You only got back to Singapore two days ago

142
00:13:54,880 --> 00:13:56,200
and today you're already here.

143
00:13:56,640 --> 00:13:58,720
Aren't you going to see Mr. Song?

144
00:13:58,960 --> 00:13:59,960
I did.

145
00:14:00,440 --> 00:14:01,920
But after seeing him

146
00:14:02,160 --> 00:14:03,359
I torched his art studio.

147
00:14:03,360 --> 00:14:04,360
What?

148
00:14:04,400 --> 00:14:05,680
Are you insane?

149
00:14:07,280 --> 00:14:08,280
Ah, come on...

150
00:14:08,720 --> 00:14:09,720
Senior

151
00:14:10,320 --> 00:14:10,960
got any food?

152
00:14:11,160 --> 00:14:12,080
I'm starving.

153
00:14:12,080 --> 00:14:13,080
No!

154
00:14:14,239 --> 00:14:14,799
Speak.

155
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:17,440
What brought you back this time?

156
00:14:17,680 --> 00:14:18,879
No straight answer,

157
00:14:18,880 --> 00:14:19,880
no food for you.

158
00:14:21,840 --> 00:14:23,320
No reason at all.

159
00:14:23,520 --> 00:14:24,920
Just came back to visit.

160
00:14:27,520 --> 00:14:29,159
The more you clam up,

161
00:14:29,160 --> 00:14:30,720
the more suspicious you look.

162
00:14:32,660 --> 00:14:33,660
Talk.

163
00:14:37,440 --> 00:14:38,919
If you won't talk,

164
00:14:38,920 --> 00:14:40,560
you're getting nothing from me.

165
00:14:58,920 --> 00:15:00,840
I found that biology professor.

166
00:15:04,320 --> 00:15:05,320
Liang Huan.
